      "side": 1,
      "message": "the add_hash_footer command itself is confusing already. why do we have to bring the confusion to other places like here? 😊\n\nAnyway, if you are \"so\" strong about keeping the same module type, I suggest this:\n\n```\navb_add_hash_footer {\n    name: \"initrd_avb_desc\",\n    src: \"initrd\",\n    // the output is the avb descriptors, not the original image\n    do_not_append_vbmeta_image: true,\n}\n\navb_add_hash_footer {\n    name: \"kernel\",\n    src: \"...\",\n    include_descriptors_from_images: [\"initrd_avb_desc\"]\n}\n```\n\n\nWe don\u0027t need `output_vbmeta_image` as the descriptor won\u0027t be installed directly.",
